Plan 3 release context: v0.1 stays a one-shot result utility, not an agent. Default-on telemetry is intentionally enum-only, identity-free, lossy, and disclosed before outbound work; Cloudflare Worker validation and disabled application logging enforce the server boundary. GitHub archives remain the primary install path, while crates.io publication is deferred until registry ownership is ready. Validation included Rust 1.82, native and static Linux builds, packaged-crate install, publish dry run, live Responses API dogfood, deployed Worker ingestion, and Analytics Engine aggregate queries.
